      "stem_html": "<p>4-dímetýlamínópýridín (DMAP) virkar sem hvati í asýlflutningsefnahvörfum. Hvatavirkni DMAP stafar af kjarnsæknum eiginleikum þess við pýridínnitrið, ekki dímetýlamínóhópinn. Útskýrðu þessa hegðun með hliðsjón af vokmyndum.</p>\n<img class=\"scaled-down-30\" src=\"https://exercises.openstax.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/proxy/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBbjhhIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--a85118657c87d91a833f0223845507b7210e43e7/OChem_24_EC_058.jpg\" alt=\"The structure of 4-dimethylaminopyridine. It has a pyridine ring linked to a nitrogen connected to two methyl groups.\">",
